flowchart TD
  A["A working session starts in the repository"] --> B["A status line is appended to the project log"]
  B --> C["The agent reads the goal register"]
  C --> D{"Does the register hold the goal and the part goals?"}
  D -->|"no"| E["Draft the register from the stated goal"]
  E --> H0["HUMAN DECISION 1: approve goal, part goals, acceptance criteria, non-goals"]
  H0 --> F
  D -->|"yes"| F["The agent restates goal, part goals and non-goals"]
  F --> G{"Is every element UNDERSTOOD?"}
  G -->|"no, blocking"| M1["Alignment meeting: one independent reviewer returning four fixed fields"]
  M1 --> CD1["Each coder states its own goal id and acceptance command"]
  CD1 --> H1["HUMAN DECISION 2: one numbered decision list"]
  H1 --> MP["The agent writes the alignment record"]
  MP --> I
  G -->|"no, not blocking"| N1["Record it and batch it to unit close"]
  N1 --> I
  G -->|"yes"| I["Pick the active unit, exactly one in flight"]
  I --> J["Write the unit contract, branch from the main line, freeze the baseline"]
  J --> J3["Anchor the frozen hash in the commit trailer, not only in the record"]
  J3 --> K["Work the unit"]
  K --> L{"Anything outside the frozen baseline?"}
  L -->|"yes"| L2["Register the change request and keep working"]
  L2 --> L3{"Disposition"}
  L3 -->|"AMEND"| H2["HUMAN DECISION 3: approve a wider baseline"]
  H2 --> J2["New frozen hash, anchored again, continue with the wider contract"]
  J2 --> K
  L3 -->|"NEXT-UNIT"| NU["Its own unit and its own branch, after this unit merges"]
  L3 -->|"DEFER or REJECT"| REG["Recorded, no human involved"]
  NU --> K
  REG --> K
  L -->|"no"| O["Unit done: tests, build, verification record"]
  O --> P["Run the gate: records, branch, hash, anchor, alignment, change register"]
  P -->|"red"| R1["Fix the cause, record the nonconformity, run the gate again"]
  R1 --> P
  P -->|"green"| Q["Commit with the unit trailer, review, merge"]
  Q --> H3["HUMAN DECISION 4: one batched list, only if items exist"]
  H3 --> S["Update the register and rotate the project log"]
  S --> T{"Context usage past the rotation threshold?"}
  T -->|"yes"| U["Rotate: a fresh session continues from the log"]
  T -->|"no"| I
  U --> I
